text: ["Faerie Conclave enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}.\\n{1}{U}: Faerie Conclave becomes a 2/1 blue Faerie creature with flying until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Treetop Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{1}{G}: Treetop Village becomes a 3/3 green Ape creature with trample until end of turn. It's still a land. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)"]
